# The repository root has its own .vercelignore that drops all of apps/ — the
# kana-trainer project deploys the repo root and serves whatever it uploads
# publicly. This app builds with Root Directory = apps/moneytracker, so it needs
# its own list; without one, the root's `apps/` rule removes package.json before
# the build runs and Vercel reports "No Next.js version detected".
node_modules
.next
.vercel
.data
.DS_Store
*.log
